
<section class="hero">

<div class="container">

<span class="badge">

🖼️ Professional Image Compression

</span>

<h1>

Compress Images
Without Losing Quality

</h1>

<p>

Reduce JPG, PNG and WebP image size
directly in your browser.

Fast, secure and completely free.

</p>

</div>

</section>

<section class="card">

<h2>

Select Image

</h2>

<input
type="file"
id="imageInput"
accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp">

<div class="mt-20">

<label>

Compression Quality

</label>

<input
type="range"
id="quality"
min="10"
max="100"
value="80">

<p
id="qualityValue">

80%

</p>

</div>

<div
id="preview"
class="mt-20">

</div>

<button
id="compressBtn"
class="btn mt-20">

Compress Image

</button>

